      "id": "claim_5280104bc9d8428d86fc2d2bd8af7e87",
      "statement": "Client bootstrap chooses its trust model from the unverified token: an OTT containing a sha root-hash claim and an http audience lets CertificateFlow.GetClient use ca.WithRootSHA256 and infer ca-url from the audience, while token-less flows require --ca-url plus an on-disk root defaulting to pki.GetRootCAPath().",
