    {
      "id": "claim_54432728f3234892b43c2b7e2fe65a0f",
      "statement": "Online token flows fetch the live provisioner list via pki.GetProvisioners(caURL, root); provisionerPrompt narrows candidates by auth flags (x5c/sshpop/nebula/k8ssa), --kid, --provisioner/--issuer, and --admin-provisioner, errors when filters empty the list or no provisioners exist, and auto-selects the single remaining provider or prompts interactively.",
