    {
      "id": "claim_db57adeb2af34fd09fddafa6db19b1aa",
      "statement": "JWK tokens support two signing-key sources: a local --key file (KMS-URI aware via cryptoutil.LoadJSONWebKey) or fetching the provisioner's encrypted key from the CA via pki.GetProvisionerKey (offline mode reads the encryptedKey property of ca.json) and decrypting it with a prompted password.",
