      "id": "claim_21b9322a0e844f898f180278ea08b3af",
      "statement": "One-time tokens are built by TokenGenerator over token/provision with a random 256-bit hex jti for replay detection, kid/iss/aud claims where the audience is the endpoint-derived URL (<ca-url>/1.0/sign|/1.0/renew|/1.0/revoke|/1.0/ssh/...), the sha root claim, sans/cnf/step/user claims as applicable, and validity enforced at 10s minimum, 1h maximum, 5m default, and a 30m maximum notBefore delay.",
