      "statement": "CreateSignRequest generates a fresh keypair per enrollment and derives CSR SANs from the token type: cloud identity tokens synthesize provider DNS names/IPs, OIDC maps email/subject into SAN and URI claims, K8sSA keeps the CLI subject, DisableCustomSANs suppresses user-controlled names, and RSA sizes below keyutil.MinRSAKeyBytes*8 are rejected outside --insecure.",
