      "statement": "Offline mode runs the full certificates/authority in-process from ca.json (password-file injected into the config) behind a package-level singleton because double initialization can deadlock backends like BadgerDB, and offline token generation mirrors the online flow with root/audience and provisioners taken from the config.",
